OL,3,GNEWSANew ice cream van-style mobile
OL,4,Alibraries hit road
OL,5,
OL,6,F"One little boy thinking I was an ice
OL,7,Fcream van, when he saw the books he was
OL,8,Foverjoyed."
OL,10,FA new chapter has begun for
OL,11,FDerbyshire's mobile library service
OL,12,Fwith two new vans heading out across
OL,13,Fthe county.
OL,15,FThe Peugeot Boxer vans have replaced
OL,16,Ftwo lorries which Derbyshire County
OL,17,FCouncil said were in "poor condition"
OL,18,Fand regularly out of action awaiting
OL,19,Frepairs.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
