OL,3,GNEWSANew ice cream van-style mobile
OL,4,Alibraries hit road
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheir reduced size means smaller roads
OL,7,Fcan be used by the mobile libraries to
OL,8,Fvisit new communities, while drivers no
OL,9,Flonger need to have an HGV licence.
